(text "M20 RP/ZERO, M21 EYES/ZERO, M22 ZERO/TOF. All three are complete LA161062 assemblies." (at 12.7 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 2333ee43-18ee-57db-abd7-7643717797ef))
(text "Each isolator side uses its actual endpoint3V3. Domain separation is implemented; brownout behavior needs bench validation." (at 12.7 258 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid b798b085-c013-57cd-a6be-d563798e75b8))
(text "J53 is EYES P2.5/P2.6 reference INPUT; never bridge it to RP or ZERO 3V3." (at 12.7 262 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 243b6dfc-4c78-5c7a-9e8f-404461caa346))
(text "Common GND is intentional. These modules separate logic power domains, not safety isolation." (at 12.7 266 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid db43cfcf-ed9d-5381-bbf1-f7d5705d00d0))
(text "Carrier rear solder lands are nominal; use short tinned wire contacts, no sockets or tall headers." (at 12.7 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 951c683f-35af-5f84-9ea7-8fc8a7699dae))
